#: desktop.cc:685
msgid ""
"Could not logout properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace. Note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Tidak dapat log keluar dengan betul\n"
"Pengurus sesi tidak dapat dihubungi. Anda boleh paksa tutup semua dengan menekan "
"Ctr+Alt+Backspace. Namun begitu, sesi semasa anda tidak dapat disimpan "
"dengan tutup semua secara paksa."

